{title: Suhana Safar Aur Ye Mausam}
{artist: Mukesh Madhumati Salil Chowdhury}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Suhana [D]safar aur [C]yeh [Em]mausam haseen
[Em]Humein darr [Am]hai hum kho [B]na jaaye kahin
[Em]Yeh kaun hansta [B]hai phoolon mein chhupkar
[B]Bahar bechain hai [Em]jiski dhun par
[Em]Kahin gungun, [Am]kahin runjhun
[Em]Ki jaise [B]nache zameen
[Em]Suhana safar...
[Em]Yeh gori nadiyon [B]ka chalna uchhalkar
[B]Ki jaise allhad [Em]chale pi se milkar
[Em]Pyare pyare [Am]yeh nazare
[Em]nisar hai [B]har kahin
[Em]Suhana safar...
[Em]Woh aasman jhuk [B]raha hai zameen par
[B]Yeh milan humne [Em]dekha yahin par
[Em]Meri duniya, [Am]mere sapne
[Em]milenge [B]shaayad yahin
[Em]Suhana safar...
